48 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 37 0 R
/E (rate, blood pressure, oxygen saturation, respiratory rate, temperature, laboratory values, and clinician observations. Unlike a standard classification task where the input may be fixed and clearly separated, deterioration prediction involves noisy, incomplete, imbalanced, and time-dependent data. In the PhysioNet Sepsis Prediction Challenge dataset used in this project, the positive deterioration/sepsis class was much smaller than the stable class, which made the task clinically and technically challenging. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
